{# =========================================================================
   Icon sprite

   Inlined once per page, hidden, then referenced with <use href="#i-name">.
   Inline rather than an external file so there is no extra request and no
   flash of missing icons, and no icon font to load.

   All icons are 24x24, stroke-based, and inherit currentColor. Keep new ones
   on the same grid and stroke width or they will not sit together.
   ========================================================================= #}

